From f7b969a8ab79ce99601bcb138957c3ff8f419a5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:53:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] notifications: show a sender's earlier messages in the
 popup

With the multi-link experiment, a new setting Popup by Sender (Never,
1 Day, 1 Week, All) makes the notification popup show the sender's
earlier notifications from that range, up to 10 messages with their
times, on one card. The earlier cards of that sender leave the popup,
and dismissing the card on iOS also dismisses the messages it shows.
Notifications are still stored one by one, so the oldest ones are
still the first to go when storage is full.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
